   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 37,
   "t": 454,
   "fen": "r4rk1/pp3ppp/2p1q3/8/8/2R1P3/PPb2PPP/3R2K1 b - - 1 19",
   "line": [
    "Rd1"
   ],
   "spoken": "White slips, and here is a free pawn — but before grabbing such a pawn, always verify your queen cannot be trapped."
  },
  {
   "ply": 38,
   "t": 484,
   "fen": "r4rk1/pp3ppp/2p5/8/8/2R1P3/qPb2PPP/3R2K1 w - - 0 20",
   "line": [
    "Qxa2"
   ],
   "spoken": "So Black takes on a2. If White tries to trap it, the queen simply returns to e6, the square it came from."
  },
  {
   "ply": 39,
   "t": 487,
   "fen": "r4rk1/pp3ppp/2p5/8/8/2R1P2P/qPb2PP1/3R2K1 b - - 0 20",
   "line": [
    "h3"
   ],
   "spoken": "Care is needed now — those queenside pawns are delicate, and a careless move allows a rook to d7."
  },
  {
   "ply": 40,
   "t": 528.5,
   "fen": "r4rk1/pp3ppp/2p1q3/8/8/2R1P2P/1Pb2PP1/3R2K1 w - - 1 21",
