   "line": [
    "Rd7"
   ],
   "spoken": "And the key detail — a rook to d8 is not needed; Black just meets the infiltration and drops the rook back.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 45,
   "t": 598,
   "fen": "r5k1/pp2rppp/2pRq3/8/8/4P2P/1Pb2PP1/3R2K1 b - - 6 23",
   "line": [
    "Re7",
    "R7d6"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
