    "Rxc6",
    "Qb5",
    "Rcd6",
    "Bb3"
   ],
   "spoken": "It resolves into a drawn rook ending — the plan is to push the b-pawn all the way and hope the defender slips, which eventually he does."
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 800,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/pppn1ppp/4pn2/3p2B1/2PP4/2N5/PP2PPPP/R2QKBNR w KQkq - 4 5",
