   "line": [
    "Bxd8"
   ],
   "spoken": "...and after the recaptures, White snatches the queen with the bishop — but this is the point.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 14,
   "t": 808.5,
   "fen": "r1bBk2r/pppn1ppp/8/3n4/1b1P4/8/PP2PPPP/R2QKBNR w KQkq - 1 8",
   "line": [
    "Bb4+"
   ],
   "spoken": "The bishop checks on b4. It is not mate — White blocks with the queen to d2 — but Black takes on d2 with check, and when the dust settles Black takes the queen and is up a clean piece.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
